<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Pengaturan Batas Stok · Mitsutoyo ERP</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/partner-portal.css"></head><body>
<header class="portal-top"><div><span class="portal-brand">MITSUTOYO ERP / INVENTORY</span><h1>Pengaturan Batas Stok</h1><p>Minimum, maksimum dan titik pemesanan ulang</p></div><nav><a href="/modules/inventory/stock-balances/<%= encodeURIComponent(stockBalanceId) %>">Kembali ke saldo</a></nav></header>
<main class="portal-main"><div id="policy-message" role="status" hidden></div><section class="portal-card"><h2 id="policy-item">Memuat saldo…</h2><p id="policy-identity"></p><div class="portal-grid" id="policy-quantities"></div><p>Nilai saldo mengikuti transaksi. Koreksi fisik dilakukan melalui Stock Opname dan approval supervisor.</p><a href="/modules/inventory/stock-opname">Buka Stock Opname</a></section><section class="portal-card"><form id="policy-form"><div class="portal-grid"><label>Minimum stok<input id="policy-min" type="number" min="0" step="any" required></label><label>Maksimum stok (opsional)<input id="policy-max" type="number" min="0" step="any"></label><label>Titik reorder (opsional)<input id="policy-reorder" type="number" min="0" step="any"></label></div><p>Notifikasi reorder memakai titik reorder positif, atau minimum stok bila titik reorder kosong/nol. Satuan mengikuti saldo.</p><button class="primary" type="submit">Simpan pengaturan</button></form></section></main>
<script id="policy-config" type="application/json"><%- JSON.stringify({stockBalanceId}).replace(/</g,'\\u003c') %></script><script src="/js/stock-policy.js" defer></script></body></html>
